# Line endings are LF everywhere, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Biome formats to LF, so a contributor with `core.autocrlf=true` — the Windows
# installer's default — gets a working tree the formatter rejects on every
# checkout, for files they never touched. Pinning it here settles it for
# everyone regardless of their local git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated dice models, VRT baselines, and the Blender source. Marked
# explicitly rather than left to git's content sniffing: a false "text" guess
# would rewrite bytes inside them.
*.png binary
*.glb binary
*.blend binary
